  "captions": {
    "ig": "11 things to know before your first sailing week with us.\n\nPack soft bags. Shoes off on deck. The cabin is yours. Wi-Fi works. The skipper teaches if you want — or you just relax.\n\nSave this. Share with your guests.\n\nJuly + August 2026 weeks still open. Link in bio.",
    "fb": "11 things to know before your first sailing week with Sailing 2 Wellness.\n\nSave this — share with your guests:\n\n1. Pack soft bags (no hard suitcases)\n2. Shoes off on deck\n3. We help you settle in from the moment you board\n4. Your cabin: queen bed, en-suite, hatch above for stargazing\n5. Wi-Fi works — 4G/5G most of the route\n6. Breakfast is a social event\n7. The Thalasso spa at Capo d'Orso is mid-week (optional, worth it)\n8. You don't have to sail — relax, swim, watch the coast move past\n9. Underway feels different than every holiday you've had\n10. The food is the story (Blue Zone, fresh seafood, on board)\n11. July + August 2026 weeks still open\n\nLink in bio for booking."
  },
